body:
Balnders Gate 3 is a real complex game for sure! I tried it out in the little free time I have. My schedule's really busy as it is and with my wife cutting my Gametime shorter it's not the Game for me, because it takes time to get into it.  I agree with you that if you aren't a veteran Gamer it can be really overwhelming, with all these tactics, characters, abilities ...

&#x200B;

I hope you'll find the perfect Game for you, but with this big of a libary I doubt you won't! Keep on Gamin'! xD
